04-tianshu:m002-0283","start":283,"end":284,"surface":"叔","kind":"person","person_id":"gyt_axg_s7t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m002-0293","start":293,"end":295,"surface":"高后","kind":"person","person_id":"mih_vxs_rhx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m002-0308","start":308,"end":311,"surface":"孝文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"xfl_kh4_hnh","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu","book_id":"b-shiji-104","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-104-tianshu"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:p003","text":"孝文帝既立，召田叔問之曰：「公知天下長者乎？」對曰：「臣何足以知之！」上曰：「公，長者也，宜知之。」叔頓首曰：「故雲中守孟舒，長者也。」是時孟舒坐虜大入塞盜劫，雲中尤甚，免。上曰：「先帝置孟舒雲中十餘年矣，虜曾一人，孟舒不能堅守，毋故士卒戰死者數百人。長者固殺人乎？公何以言孟舒為長者也？」叔叩頭對曰：「是乃孟舒所以為長者也。夫貫高等謀反，上下明詔，趙有敢隨張王，罪三族。然孟舒自髡鉗，隨張王敖之所在，欲以身死之，豈自知為雲中守哉！漢與楚相距，士卒罷敝。匈奴冒頓新服北夷，來為邊害，孟舒知士卒罷敝，不忍出言，士爭臨城死敵，如子為父，弟為兄，以故死者數百人。孟舒豈故驅戰之哉！是乃孟舒所以為長者也。」於是上曰：「賢哉孟舒！」復召孟舒以為雲中守。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m003-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"孝文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"xfl_kh4_hnh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m003-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"田叔","kind":"person","person_id":"gyt_axg_s7t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m003-0035","start":35,"end":36,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"xfl_kh4_hnh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m003-0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"叔","kind":"person","person_id":"gyt_axg_s7t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m003-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"孟舒","kind":"person","person_id":"jh5_kh6_e9k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m003-0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"孟舒","kind":"person","person_id":"jh5_kh6_e9k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-104-tianshu:m003-0087","start":87,"end":88,"surface":"上","kind":"person","perso